# Band changes for watched characters (DESIGN.md §8.3): other modules hear when someone's
# view of a watched character crosses into another band, not every 0.01 of movement.
load content/sample
act player steal --target merchant_ava
act player steal --target merchant_ava
watch player
watching
# The fine of DESIGN.md §8.2: the Watch (affinity -7.24, standing -20.00) and Captain Hale
# (-29.10) both turn unfriendly. No one else's view of the player changes.
outcome fined_by_watch player
assert disposition city_watch player == -27.24 (unfriendly)
watching
# A small good deed moves scores within their bands, so nothing is reported.
act player help_stranger --target merchant_ava
assert unwatch vex == error: vex isn't watched
unwatch player
assert watching == no one is watched yet
